__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
dist/
# ...except the vendored workflow-asset bundles. They have no source in this
# repo -- `workflow-assets/` holds only `dist/` and `skills/` -- and `skills/`
# ships in the package, so an untracked bundle means a clean-checkout publish
# ships skills whose scripts import a file that is not there.
!skills/*/workflow-assets/dist/
*.egg-info/
.idea
node_modules
.pnpm-store
coverage/
evals/reports/
evals/.seed-cache/
evals/.bin/
.npmrc
!.npmrc
builtin-modules/
reports/

# Rendered variants are written to a temporary directory by the template gate
# and removed afterwards. This entry catches a run interrupted before its
# `finally`, so a stray tree never reaches a commit.
quoin-semantic-module-*/

# Cargo build output for the Rust workspace (quoin#375). `rust/target/` is the
# EXPLICIT target dir every gate names on the command line; an inherited
# CARGO_TARGET_DIR moves the artifact somewhere else and leaves a stale binary
# here, which is how a measurement gets attributed to a build that is four
# days old (see the bench-tier1 note in the Makefile).
rust/target/
